<section class="band">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="page-panel">
            <p class="eyebrow">The shop</p>
            <h1>A sports store with a counter, a stock room, and a catalog.</h1>
            <p class="page-copy">SportsStore is the system the shop uses to keep products, suppliers, and customer orders in one place. Customers browse what is in stock. Staff pack paid orders and update quantities when a delivery arrives.</p>
            <p class="page-copy mb-0">The public site is the catalog. The administration area, added as the project grows, is where the shop manages brands, prices, and the orders waiting to be shipped.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
